warning
# Issue #2051: a rework cap escalation (dispatch_rework's no-op /
# worker-death / blocked-environment redispatch caps, or the janitor
# attempts caps in _route_janitor_gate_failure_to_rework) was due this
# pass but deferred because issue_worker_liveness reports a live worker
# still holding the issue -- escalation would hand the branch to
# operator-queue while the worker is still writing it. Warning, not
# error: handled and re-evaluated next pass (the cap is never consumed,
# so the escalation fires as soon as the worker exits or wedges), but the
# operator must be able to see that the cap tripped and was suppressed.
# Emitted once per worker session via the
# escalation_deferred_live_worker marker on the issue record; consumed by
# tests/test_cap_escalation_deferred_live_worker.py.
